%% Context: Accounts-payable invoice approval and payment run, from receipt to remittance.
flowchart TD
  A([Invoice received]) --> B[/Scan and capture invoice/]
  B --> C[(Look up purchase order)]
  C --> D{PO match found?}
  D -->|No| E[Request PO from requester]
  E -.-> C
  D -->|Yes| F{Amount over $10,000?}
  subgraph Approval [Approval]
    F -->|Yes| G[[Route to CFO]]
    F -->|No| H[Route to department head]
    G --> I{Approved?}
    H --> I
  end
  I -->|No| J[Notify vendor of dispute]
  J --> K([Invoice rejected])
  I -->|Yes| L[Schedule payment run]
  L --> M[Post entry to ledger]
  M --> N[/Send remittance advice/]
  N --> O([Invoice paid])
